+This project follows the [Contributor Covenant, version 2.1](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/).
+
+In short: be respectful and constructive, assume good faith, and keep discussions about the code and the problem at hand. Harassment, personal attacks and discriminatory language are not tolerated in issues, pull requests or any other project space.
