+## Reporting
+
+Report unacceptable behaviour privately to the maintainer ([@botnick](https://github.com/botnick)) — for example through a [private security advisory](https://github.com/botnick/telegram-media-downloader/security/advisories/new) if you need a confidential channel. Reports are handled confidentially, and the maintainer may remove, edit or reject contributions, or block contributors, that don't follow this code.
